    "reviewDetail": {
      "ok": true,
      "status": 200,
      "body": {
        "data": {
          "type": "appStoreReviewDetails",
          "id": "aa38b346-c5e9-48ae-9e61-9833c984f7c2",
          "attributes": {
            "contactFirstName": "Danario",
            "contactLastName": "Edgar II",
            "contactPhone": "2819046431",
            "contactEmail": "djedgar00@gmail.com",
            "demoAccountName": "djedgar00@gmail.com",
            "demoAccountPassword": "Edgar2026",
            "demoAccountRequired": true,
            "notes": "DEMO ACCOUNT:\nEmail: djedgar00@gmail.com\nPassword: Edgar2026\n\nGUIDELINE 5.1.1(v) UPDATE / GUEST ACCESS:\nVersion 1.0 (build 29+) no longer requires registration to browse non-account-based content. From a fresh install, reviewers can tap \"Continue as Guest\" on the auth screen or simply use the bottom tabs without entering personal information.\n\nAvailable without login:\n- Discover tab: browse/search DJs, filter by genre, and open public DJ profiles.\n- Bookings tab: view the public booking explainer and booking workflow details.\n- DJ profile → Book DJ: open the booking form, enter event details, and review rates/estimated totals before login. Login is requested only when tapping \"Send Booking Request\" because that creates an account-specific booking record.\n- Messages tab: view the public messaging overview/demo explaining how DJ/venue messaging works.\n- More → Subscription Plans: view all Starter/Pro/Elite subscription prices, features, legal text, and privacy link.\n\nLogin is required only for account-specific actions/data:\n- Sending/creating a booking request, viewing private booking history, or managing booking status.\n- Opening a private message inbox/thread or sending messages.\n- Purchasing/restoring/managing a subscription tied to a user account.\n- Managing profile, contracts, saved library, notifications, or deleting/logging out of an account.\n\nThis app does not collect email, name, or password just to browse DJs, booking information, messages overview, or subscription plan information.\n\nDemo account access remains available for testing private account-based features including booking management, conversations, profile, library, and subscription management.\n\nNo payment is required to test the booking request preview flow. Tap any DJ → \"Book DJ\" to view and fill the booking form as a guest; login is prompted only when sending the request.\n\nThe Mix Store allows DJs to sell downloadable audio mixes. Purchases redirect to the secure web platform (reader app model — no in-app payments).\n\nSUPPORT URL: https://beat-match-production.up.railway.app/support\nMARKETING URL: https://beat-match-production.up.railway.app\n"
          },
